{"seq":2,"slug":"deep-rec-models","title":"深度推荐模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-recommendation-systems/rec-algorithms/deep-rec-models","wordCount":828,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"深度推荐模型\">深度推荐模型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>深度推荐模型（Deep Recommendation Models）利用深度学习自动学习特征交互和用户偏好，突破了传统方法依赖手工特征工程的瓶颈。从 Wide &amp; Deep 开始，深度推荐模型经历了从简单 MLP 到注意力机制、图神经网络和序列建模的快速演进。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 模型演进&#10;        WD[Wide &amp; Deep] --&gt; DCN_R[DCN]&#10;        WD --&gt; DFM[DeepFM]&#10;        DFM --&gt; DIN_M[DIN]&#10;        DIN_M --&gt; DIEN_M[DIEN]&#10;        DIEN_M --&gt; SIM_M[SIM]&#10;        DCN_R --&gt; DCNv2_M[DCN-V2]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 序列建模&#10;        DIN_M&#10;        DIEN_M&#10;        SIM_M&#10;        BERT4REC[BERT4Rec]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 模型演进\n        WD[Wide &amp; Deep] --&gt; DCN_R[DCN]\n        WD --&gt; DFM[DeepFM]\n        DFM --&gt; DIN_M[DIN]\n        DIN_M --&gt; DIEN_M[DIEN]\n        DIEN_M --&gt; SIM_M[SIM]\n        DCN_R --&gt; DCNv2_M[DCN-V2]\n    end\n    subgraph 序列建模\n        DIN_M\n        DIEN_M\n        SIM_M\n        BERT4REC[BERT4Rec]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>核心创新</th>\n<th>特征交互</th>\n<th>序列建模</th>\n<th>工业应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Wide &amp; Deep</td>\n<td>记忆+泛化</td>\n<td>Wide线性+Deep DNN</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>Google Play</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DeepFM</td>\n<td>FM 自动交叉</td>\n<td>FM层+DNN</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>华为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DCN-V2</td>\n<td>显式交叉网络</td>\n<td>Cross Network</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>Google</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DIN</td>\n<td>Target Attention</td>\n<td>Attention加权</td>\n<td>简单序列</td>\n<td>阿里</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DIEN</td>\n<td>兴趣演化建模</td>\n<td>Attention+GRU</td>\n<td>兴趣演化</td>\n<td>阿里</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SIM</td>\n<td>超长序列建模</td>\n<td>硬搜索+软搜索</td>\n<td>超长序列</td>\n<td>阿里</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"wide-deep-与特征交叉网络\">Wide &amp; Deep 与特征交叉网络</h2><p>Wide &amp; Deep 模型由 Google 在 2016 年提出，将线性模型（Wide）的记忆能力和深度网络（Deep）的泛化能力结合。Wide 部分捕获高频的特征组合模式，Deep 部分学习低频和未见过的特征交互。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface WideDeepConfig {&#10;  wideFeatures: string[];&#10;  deepFeatures: string[];&#10;  deepLayers: number[];&#10;  embeddingDim: number;&#10;  dropout: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function wideDeepForward(&#10;  wideInput: Float32Array,&#10;  deepInput: Float32Array,&#10;  wideWeight: Float32Array,&#10;  deepLayers: MLPLayer[],&#10;): number {&#10;  const wideOutput = dotProduct(wideInput, wideWeight);&#10;&#10;  let hidden = deepInput;&#10;  for (const layer of deepLayers) {&#10;    hidden = relu(addVec(matVecMul(layer.weight, hidden), layer.bias));&#10;  }&#10;  const deepOutput = hidden[0];&#10;&#10;  return sigmoid(wideOutput + deepOutput);&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface DCNv2Config {&#10;  inputDim: number;&#10;  crossLayers: number;&#10;  deepLayers: number[];&#10;  mixType: &#39;parallel&#39; | &#39;stacked&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function crossNetworkV2(x0: Float32Array, crossLayers: CrossLayerV2[]): Float32Array {&#10;  let xi = new Float32Array(x0);&#10;&#10;  for (const layer of crossLayers) {&#10;    const projected = matVecMul(layer.weightMatrix, xi);&#10;    const next = new Float32Array(x0.length);&#10;    for (let j = 0; j &lt; x0.length; j++) {&#10;      next[j] = x0[j] * projected[j] + layer.bias[j] + xi[j];&#10;    }&#10;    xi = next;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return xi;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WideDeepConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  wideFeatures</span><span style=\"co